.SS run
.sp
Launch claude in a fresh container. Args after \fB\-\-\fP pass through to claude.
.sp
Usage
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
sbclaude run [OPTIONS] [CLAUDE_ARGS]...
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Options
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-p, \-\-project <project>
Project dir (read\-write, becomes the workdir). Default: cwd.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-w, \-\-rw <rw_extra>
Extra read\-write mount.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-r, \-\-ro <ro_extra>
Extra read\-only mount.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-n, \-\-name <name>
Container name (default: sbclaude\-<project>).
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-i, \-\-image <image>
Image override.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-debian\-mirror <debian_mirror>
Debian archive mirror to bake in if the image is (re)built, e.g. \X'tty: link http://ftp.us.debian.org/debian'\fI\%http://ftp.us.debian.org/debian\fP\X'tty: link'\&.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-memory <memory>
Docker memory limit, e.g. 8g. Default auto\-caps from host RAM; \(aq0\(aq disables. Only applied when hardening is on.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-cpus <cpus>
Docker CPU limit, e.g. 4. Only applied when hardening is on.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-R, \-\-re
Enable the Ghidra and Android host mounts together.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-ghidra
Mount host Ghidra (read\-only).
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-gpu
Expose the host GPUs.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-android
Mount Android SDK + ~/.android + kvm.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-usb
Expose /dev/bus/usb for adb.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-ios
Mount the host usbmuxd socket so frida can reach an iOS device.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-wayland
Forward the Wayland socket for GUIs (preferred over \-\-x11).
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-x11
Forward DISPLAY + XAUTHORITY for GUIs.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-ssh
Mount the host ~/.ssh read\-only and forward the ssh\-agent for SSH git remotes.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-gpg
Mount the host GnuPG home and agent socket for signing commits.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-sudo
Allow passwordless sudo in the box. Drops no\-new\-privileges, without which no setuid binary can escalate.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-net <network>
Docker network mode (default: host; use \(dqbridge\(dq to isolate).
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-e, \-\-env <env_extra>
Extra env var KEY=VALUE for the box, e.g. \-e CLAUDE_CODE_USE_BEDROCK=1.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-venv\-dir <venv_dir>
Directory in the box holding its virtualenv, e.g. a volume\(aqs mount point. Default: .sbclaude\-venv beside a Python project.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-no\-harden
Disable the container hardening flags (cap\-drop, no\-new\-privileges, ...).
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-no\-modify
Stop sbclaude writing anything into the project directory: no .gitignore entry, no virtualenv beside it, and no session\-recover install. Claude itself can still edit the project.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-session\-recover
Install cc\-session\-recover (auto\-resume) into the project on start.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-d, \-\-debug
Enable debug level logging.
.UNINDENT
.sp
Arguments
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B CLAUDE_ARGS
Optional argument(s)
.UNINDENT
.SS scaffold\-noclip
.sp
Scaffold a noclip visual\-regression harness into TARGET (default: the current directory).
.sp
Writes viewer\-tests/ (glue, config, baselines/, out/) plus a getting\-started guide. The
\fBwebshot\fP tool it drives is already installed in the box. Other harnesses, if they are ever
added, get their own \fBscaffold\-<kind>\fP command rather than a flag on this one.
.sp
Usage
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
sbclaude scaffold\-noclip [OPTIONS] [TARGET]
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Options
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-f, \-\-force
Overwrite files that already exist.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-s, \-\-scene <scene>
Scene id for the generated config, e.g. MyGame/Level1.
.UNINDENT
.sp
Arguments
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B TARGET
Optional argument
.UNINDENT
.SS shell
.sp
Open a debug shell inside a running box, as the user the box mirrors.
.sp
Usage
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
sbclaude shell [OPTIONS]
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Options
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-n, \-\-name <name>
Container name. Default: the current project\(aqs box.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-root
Open the shell as root instead of the mapped user.
.UNINDENT
.SS stop
.sp
Stop running boxes (every box for the current project by default).
.sp
Usage
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
sbclaude stop [OPTIONS]
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Options
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-n, \-\-name <name>
Container name. Default: every box for the current project.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-all
Stop every sbclaude container.
.UNINDENT
